{"fw-02":[{"t":"vocab","h":"Words for this lesson","items":[{"ko":"저","en":"I (humble)","ex":"저는 마크예요."},{"ko":"학생","en":"student","ex":"저는 학생이에요."},{"ko":"한국 사람","en":"Korean person","ex":"저는 한국 사람이에요."},{"ko":"이름","en":"name","ex":"제 이름은 안나예요."}]},{"t":"dictate","say":"저는 학생이에요","answers":["저는 학생이에요"],"hint":"Four syllables, then 이에요.","why":"학생 ends in a consonant, so 이에요."},{"t":"write","q":"Introduce yourself in one sentence: “I am ___.” (your name or job)","must":["저는"],"sample":"저는 안나예요.","why":"Name ending in a vowel → 예요, in a consonant → 이에요."},{"t":"passage","h":"Read a little","ko":["안녕하세요. 저는 안나예요.","저는 학생이에요.","저는 한국 사람이 아니에요."],"en":["Hello. I am Anna.","I am a student.","I am not Korean."]},{"t":"choice","q":"What is Anna?","options":["student","teacher","doctor"],"answer":0,"why":"저는 학생이에요 — “I am a student.”"},{"t":"choice","q":"Is Anna Korean?","options":["No","Yes"],"answer":0,"why":"한국 사람이 아니에요 — “I am not Korean.”"},{"t":"expand","base":{"tokens":["저는","학생이에요."],"en":"I am a student."},"steps":[{"tokens":["저는","한국어","학생이에요."],"en":"I am a Korean-language student."},{"tokens":["저는","서울의","한국어","학생이에요."],"en":"I am a Korean-language student in Seoul."}]},{"t":"cando","items":["I can say my name: “저는 ○○예요.”","I can say my job: “저는 학생이에요.”","I can choose 예요 or 이에요 by the last sound."]}]}
